{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search and retrieve an object: if moving, stop. If object within reach, take it and inspect it. Otherwise, move or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = Stop    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsMoving    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
